」曰：「未能也。」「其不可六矣。放牛桃林之陰，以示不復輸積。今陛下能放牛不復輸積乎？」曰：「未能也。」「其不可七矣。且天下游士離其親戚，棄墳墓，去故舊，從陛下游者，徒欲日夜望咫尺之地。今復六國，立韓、魏、燕、趙、齊、楚之後，天下游士各歸事其主，從其親戚，反其故舊墳墓，陛下與誰取天下乎？其不可八矣。且夫楚唯無彊，六國立者復橈而從之，陛下焉得而臣之？誠用客之謀，陛下事去矣。」漢王輟食吐哺，罵曰：「豎儒，幾敗而公事！」令趣銷印。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"食其","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003378","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003373","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"子房","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003378","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"子房","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003373","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"張良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003359","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003392","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003383","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-055-liu:m015-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","per